For $Y$ to be a Snake number, we need $d > y_i$ for all $i \in \{2, \dots, n\}$.
The digits $y_2, \dots, y_n$ can be any digit from $\{0, \dots, d-1\}$.
There are $d$ choices for each of the $n-1$ positions.
